// #3102: the build categories — ONE set for the crafting list, the blueprints, the ship modules, the cargo hold, the
// backpack and the Sandbox catalogue. A thing may sit in several categories (the jetpack is "Travel & Transport" AND
// "Suit & Survival"). Presentation only: no server rule reads this file.
//
// Membership of a category = its lists + its "derive" rules:
//   weapon / vehicle / suitGear / consumable / materials — item rules (tool kind, vehicle, worn gear, item category)
//   fromBlueprints — every item a recipe makes behind one of THIS category's blueprints (the whole Crystal Net)
//   allModules / allShips — every ship module / every ship
// An item that no list and no rule names lands in the categories whose "fallbackFor" holds its item category, and a
// blueprint that no list names takes the categories of what it unlocks — content added later is findable without
// touching this file. ContentCategoriesTests guard the keys, the coverage and the names (en + de).
